{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"(think of it like the Fallout games perk of the grim reaper. Where you Crit and a ghost appears to kill the enemy for you. It's like your claws have the sharpness of the ghost's blade)","created_at":"2020-08-10T08:30:47.077000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742298891906580580","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"A piece of parchment is left on the Round Table. It also has the magic mouth inscription on it that reads it aloud in Florian’s voice if a Knight approaches it.\n\n```I visited the hanging tree last night after the expedition. Something didn't sit right. There was a Masonic rune in front of the tree and the words of the Hunger's name were made of the same engraving tool... By the Masons. \n\nMy guess is that they aim to continue the cycle of the Hunger instead of aiming to end it. Whether or not that is exactly what they plan, one thing I know for certain... They do not plan or care about restoring balance from the loss of the divine, and aim to take favor from the wardens of Arcania instead. The people we all know in the Masons are not bad people, but their vision is flawed to the point that it does not help the most amount of people. It aims to keep what was consumed within the Abyssal plane, regenerating.\n\nThe masonic words of Croatoan appeared in one other place... The kvatch hatch on the Tir Na Nog, where the portal was. We must ensure our goal is completed so that the hunger may never regenerate again and that those we have lost would be seen restored. Be discretionary when interacting with them. They are our friends, but their goals do not align with protecting the most amount of people.```","created_at":"2020-08-10T16:52:24.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"742425129275097138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
